{"id":"655525","name":"捞汁大虾","author":"和月香","authorId":"12842754","desc":"","cover":"images/655525/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"500克"}],"sub":[{"name":"小香葱","amount":"5根"},{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"3个"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"5瓣"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"1/4个"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"2根"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"1段"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"用到的主要材料。","img":"images/655525/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"虾处理干净放入盆中，加葱段、姜丝、料酒、胡椒粉，抓匀腌制20分钟。","img":"images/655525/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洋葱、姜切丝，香菜、小香葱切段、辣椒、蒜切粒。","img":"images/655525/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中添水，水开后倒入腌制的虾，水再次沸腾后煮2分钟。","img":"images/655525/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞入冰水冰镇一下。","img":"images/655525/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"虾捞出控水，装入大碗。","img":"images/655525/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入配菜。","img":"images/655525/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加没过食材的捞汁，拌匀。","img":"images/655525/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"腌制一小时以上，时间越长越入味。","img":"images/655525/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"吃的时候简单摆个盘。","img":"images/655525/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大虾鲜美爽口，Q弹入味，好吃。","img":"images/655525/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"餐桌上最受欢迎的一道菜。","img":"images/655525/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}